        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we expect that products containing ClearSign Core™ technology will sell at prices based on the value they offer rather than pursuant to standard competitive pricing that our competitors are forced to use in these mature markets.",
        "start_character": 52968,
        "end_character": 53209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As indicated above, we are seeking to develop our business in the combustion and emissions control market and to establish ourselves in a highly competitive industry among companies that have substantial financial resources, a well-developed infrastructure and established products.",
        "start_character": 42771,
        "end_character": 43053
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we seek to expand the markets into which we can sell our products, we plan to continue extending the range of ClearSign CoreTM process burners to enable the replacement of other burner types and configurations, as well as for use in alternate process applications.",
        "start_character": 29887,
        "end_character": 30154
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By developing our ClearSign CoreTM technology into a replacement product, we have been able to standardize our designs and simplify supply chain",
        "start_character": 24011,
        "end_character": 24155
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For fire tube products, we have developed our own patent protected burner replacement product that is similar in concept to our ClearSign CoreTM burners for process heaters.",
        "start_character": 32498,
        "end_character": 32671
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, although we have highly skilled and experienced employees, we do not have the manpower to provide comprehensive service and customer support ourselves.",
        "start_character": 45455,
        "end_character": 45615
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to targeting OEM manufacturers and service providers to augment our manufacturing footprint and on-time service capabilities, we target sales and marketing efforts at OEM heater companies and engineering companies supporting our refining, petrochemical and energy infrastructure customers.",
        "start_character": 49848,
        "end_character": 50149
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have a collaborative agreement with California Boiler to sell and produce both fire tube boiler burner and flare products.",
        "start_character": 49024,
        "end_character": 49162
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business development activities are now focused on developing customer acceptance and adoption within what we believe are the most efficient channels to market.",
        "start_character": 22885,
        "end_character": 23049
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037699-4fe938bc27104633",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037699",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The presentation of financial results as one reportable segment is consistent with the way that we operate our business and the manner in which our chief operating decision maker, currently our Chief Executive Officer, manages our operations for purposes of allocating resources and assessing financial results.",
        "start_character": 53518,
        "end_character": 53829
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037699",
